# Always Recompile PDF

After any edit to the CV (especially `rey.tex` or related `.tex` / `.cls` / `.bib` files), always recompile before ending the turn.

```bash
cd /home/reyshwanth/onepagecv && latexmk -pdf -g -interaction=nonstopmode rey.tex
```

- Do not wait for the user to ask to recompile
- Prefer a forced rebuild (`-g`) so the PDF is fresh
- Confirm the build succeeded (e.g. pages written / `rey.pdf` updated)
- If the compile fails, fix the error and recompile again in the same turn
